1) Water pumping station in Toretsk (Donetsk region);
2) Water pumping station of II level lifting at the Siverskyi Donets-Donbas channel, Orikhovatka village (Donetsk region);
3) Water pumping station in Stara Krasnianka village (Luhansk region)

