El efecto 1.3 del PGT13 se enfoca en:
1. Provisión de directrices y normas autorizadas sobre calidad, seguridad y eficacia de productos sanitarios, medicamentos esenciales y listas de diagnóstico;
2. Fortalecimiento de la capacidad nacional reguladora y mejora del suministro de productos sanitarios seguros y de calidad garantizada, incluso mediante servicios precalificados;
3. Forlecimiento del país en el abordaje de la resistencia a los antimicrobianos mediante sistemas de vigilancia fortalecidos, capacidad laboratorial, prevención y control de infecciones, sensibilización y políticas y prácticas basadas en evidencia.

Specific objective 1: To strengthen the legal, policy and regulatory frameworks related to labour migration and labour standards, with a focus on the fishing and seafood processing sectors in South East Asia;
Specific objective 2: To protect labour rights and promote safe and secure working environments, in particular for all migrant workers from recruitment to post-admission and end of the contract;
Specific objective 3: To empower migrant workers, their families, organisations and communities to promote and exercise their rights

The ILO aims to accelerate replication of promising practices and identify new solutions to end forced labour and child labour including in Indonesia fishing industry. The strategy will be:
1. Identifying, scaling up or replicating solutions to end forced labour and child labour;
2. Developing sector of supply chain specific solution when needed; 
3. Leveraging innovation and new technologies to accelerate progress towards SDG Target 8.7; and
4. Establishing a smarter financing approach of SDG 8.7 to maximize the impact of partners' contributions and increase investment in innovative solutions

